---
interface DevFilter {
  key: string;
  label: string;
}
interface DevItem {
  id: string;
  cat: string;
  badge: string;
  title: string;
  sub: string;
  img: string;
  repoUrl: string;
  repoLabel: string;
  desc: string;
  tags: string[];
  type: string;
}
interface Props {
  filters: DevFilter[];
  items: DevItem[];
}
const { filters, items } = Astro.props;
const firstDev = items[0];
---
<section id="bagian-development" class="discipline-section">
  <div class="discipline-header">
    <div class="discipline-title-stack">
      <div class="title-with-counter">
        <h2 class="discipline-title">Software Development</h2>
        <span class="section-counter-pill">Android Kotlin &middot; AI &middot; IoT</span>
      </div>
      <p class="discipline-lead">
        Rekayasa perangkat lunak aplikasi mandiri, integrasi perangkat keras kamera &amp; printer via USB, pembayaran QRIS otomatis, serta komputasi AI generatif.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-bar-wrap">
      <div id="devFilterBar" class="skill-workbench" role="toolbar" aria-label="Filter kategori pengembangan">
        {filters.map((f, i) => (
          <button
            class={`tool-chip${i === 0 ? ' active' : ''}`}
            type="button"
            aria-pressed={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
            onclick={`filterDevWorks('${f.key}', this)`}
          >
            {f.label}
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rubooth-bento-grid">
    <div class="bento-cell bento-hero-stage">
      <div class="stage-topbar">
        <span id="devStageBadge" class="stage-badge">{firstDev ? firstDev.badge : 'PEMBUATAN APLIKASI'}</span>
        <button type="button" class="stage-expand-btn" onclick="openDevModalByIndex(0)">
          Detail Arsitektur &nearr;
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-frame stage-clickable" onclick="openDevModalByIndex(0)">
        <img
          id="devStageImg"
          src={firstDev ? firstDev.img : 'assets/rubooth_banner.jpg'}
          alt={firstDev ? firstDev.title : 'RUBOOTH Smart Photobooth'}
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="stage-meta-box">
        <h3 id="devStageTitle" class="stage-info-title">{firstDev ? firstDev.title : ''}</h3>
        <p id="devStageDesc" class="stage-info-desc">{firstDev ? firstDev.desc : ''}</p>
        <div class="stage-repo-actions">
          <a
            id="devStageRepoLink"
            href={firstDev ? firstDev.repoUrl : 'https://github.com/alkhairan18/rubooth'}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="repo-link-btn"
          >
            Buka Kode Sumber di GitHub ({firstDev ? firstDev.repoLabel : 'github.com/alkhairan18/rubooth'}) &nearr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-cell bento-spec-column">
      <div class="bento-subgrid">
        <article class="arch-tile arch-tile-accent">
          <div class="arch-tile-meta">MODUL PERANGKAT KERAS</div>
          <h4 class="arch-tile-title">Dual-Camera USB PTP &amp; UVC</h4>
          <p class="arch-tile-desc">Pratinjau langsung (<em>live view</em>) mulus via webcam USB UVC yang dipadukan dengan jepretan resolusi tinggi kamera DSLR Canon EOS melalui protokol USB PTP.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="arch-tile">
          <div class="arch-tile-meta">KECERDASAN BUATAN</div>
          <h4 class="arch-tile-title">Google Gemini Generative AI</h4>
          <p class="arch-tile-desc">Pemrosesan komposisi gambar cerdas yang memungkinkan pengguna berfoto bersama figur idola secara otomatis langsung di layar kios.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="arch-tile">
          <div class="arch-tile-meta">TRANSAKSI MANDIRI</div>
          <h4 class="arch-tile-title">Midtrans Snap QRIS Otomatis</h4>
          <p class="arch-tile-desc">Alur pembayaran nirsentuh (<em>cashless</em>) dengan pembuatan kode QR dinamis dan pembukaan kunci sesi foto otomatis begitu transaksi terverifikasi.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="arch-tile arch-tile-tinted">
          <div class="arch-tile-meta">IOT &amp; CETAK INSTAN</div>
          <h4 class="arch-tile-title">Firebase IoT &amp; Epson L8050 3R</h4>
          <p class="arch-tile-desc">Sinkronisasi lampu studio pintar melalui Firebase Realtime Database serta antrean cetak otomatis ukuran 3R langsung ke printer foto Epson L8050.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-index-box">
        <div class="work-list-heading">
          <span>INDEKS REPOSITORI SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT</span>
          <span>KLIK DETAIL / BUKA GITHUB</span>
        </div>
        <div id="devWorkList">
          {items.map((item, idx) => (
            <div
              class="work-row"
              tabindex="0"
              role="button"
              onmouseenter={`previewDevStageByIndex(${idx})`}
              onfocus={`previewDevStageByIndex(${idx})`}
              onclick={`openDevModalByIndex(${idx})`}
              onkeydown={`if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();openDevModalByIndex(${idx});}`}
            >
              <img class="work-thumb" src={item.img} alt={item.title} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div>
                <div class="work-row-name">{item.title}</div>
                <div class="work-row-sub">{item.sub}</div>
              </div>
              <div class="work-row-actions">
                <a href={item.repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="work-row-github" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
                  GitHub &nearr;
                </a>
                <span class="work-row-cta">Detail</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
